algorithms.pseudocode:
function findWord(triple):
  t ← triple
  word ← []
  while t ≠ (3,4,5):
    for g in {A, B, C}:
      candidate ← INVERSE[g] × t
      if all(candidate > 0):
        word.prepend(g)
        t ← candidate
        break
  return word

Time: O(log c) where c = hypotenuse
Space: O(log c)

function computeClosure(generators, modulus=3):
  closure ← {I} ∪ generators
  queue ← generators
  while queue not empty:
    M ← queue.dequeue()
    for G in generators:
      P ← (M × G) mod modulus
      if P ∉ closure:
        closure.add(P)
        queue.enqueue(P)
  return closure

Result: |closure| = 24 = |SL(2,F₃)|
